msgstr ""
"cadre-photo.local, .home or Tailscale: no need to know the IP address any"
" more."

#: frontend/src/news.ts:31
msgid "GIF animés"
msgstr "Animated GIFs"

#: frontend/src/news.ts:32
msgid ""
"Acceptés par tous les imports et animés à l'écran, en photo seule comme "
"dans les dispositions."
msgstr ""
"Accepted by every import and animated on screen, as a single photo and in"
" layouts."

