"suivent dans le diaporama ou la playlist, dans leur ordre ; un message "
"qui en fait partie devient une note."
msgstr ""
"Check the slideshow layouts. With “Single photo” and compositions: one "
"composition every N photos. Without “Single photo”: compositions only. A "
"composition groups the photos that come next in the slideshow or "
"playlist, in order; a message among them becomes a note."

