"à l'arrivée)."
msgstr ""
"The frame uses the faces you have named in Immich. Tap a person to show "
"their photos; “Follow” also imports all their photos from Immich, even "
"outside the chosen album. Their “Photos of …” playlist can start when "
"they arrive home (Screen › Display › Wake on arrival)."

#: templates/configure/tab_sources.html.jinja:122
